            "created_at": "2026-10-13T21:57:07.831Z",
            "cooked": "<p>Hi — I build the kind of AI attendance and lead-engagement engines this board keeps asking for. Not slides: production.</p>\n<p><strong>Live demos you can poke right now</strong> (send any message — even nonsense — and watch it classify intent, answer FAQ, log orders, score leads, and escalate to a human with full context when confidence is low; designed NOT to invent answers):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Command Center: <a href=\"https://devmosaalhaj.github.io/leadlens-poc/\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">LeadLens Command Center — Operação E-commerce ao Vivo</a></li>\n<li>AI attendance engine: <a href=\"https://devmosaalhaj.github.io/leadlens-poc/atendimento-ia.html\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Atendimento IA no WhatsApp — Demo ao vivo (motor real)</a></li>\n<li>Construction/real-estate lead flow: <a href=\"https://devmosaalhaj.github.io/leadlens-poc/construtora-mcmv.html\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">ObraFlow — Gestão MCMV · Protótipo Interativo</a></li>\n<li>Meta leads → instant follow-up: <a href=\"https://devmosaalhaj.github.io/leadlens-poc/meta-leads.html\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Automação Meta Ads → WhatsApp — resposta ao lead em segundos (demo ao vivo)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What you get per project</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Conversation classification with confidence thresholds + human escalation carrying the full history</li>\n<li>FAQ answering against YOUR bases/APIs (not static text)</li>\n<li>Automatic actions (tickets, status, notes) with idempotency and X-Hub-Signature-validated webhooks</li>\n<li>Error branches, retries with exponential backoff, alerting hooks — not duct tape</li>\n<li>Code nodes in clean JavaScript (no Python), each with self-tests before promoting</li>\n<li>Versioned, documented JSON + README per workflow, semantic versioning, changelog</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Stack:</strong> n8n self-hosted, Node.js, PostgreSQL, GitHub Actions. WhatsApp Cloud API (official) + Meta webhook validation in production today.</p>\n<p><strong>Background:</strong> Senior Integration Engineer &amp; iPaaS Architect (<a href=\"http://mosaahmad.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">mosaahmad.com</a>) — architected Reachware Studio’s iPaaS engine (thousands of API calls/day across ERP, e-commerce, CRM).</p>\n<p><strong>Rate:</strong> US$ 35–45/h, or fixed per project by phases (40/60). Immediate availability. PT/EN/ES.</p>\n<p>Happy to do a <strong>paid trial workflow</strong> first so you can judge the handoff quality risk-free. What does your typical first project look like in scope/hours?</p>",
